{"resourceIdentifier":"3024","resourceName":"Puwangzi Afforestation Project","description":"Puwangzi Afforestation Project (hereafter refer to as “the project”) is located within Pu’an county, Wangmo county in Qianxinan Buyi and Miao Autonomous Prefecture and Ziyun county in Anshun city, Guizhou Province of China. It is an inland province, bordering Yunnan to the west, Sichuan to the northwest, Hunan to the east and Chongqing to the North. The province has a total population of 34 million. The project aims to plant native species on suitable land for forest  for GHG removal whilst contributing to local sustainable development goals.\r\n25,901 ha (388,515 Mu ) of forest was planted on suitable land for forest in Pu’an county, Wangmo county in and Ziyun county which used to be poor sustainable ecological environment and karst rocky desertification. Prior to the project, the project area was suitable land for forest, there is no forestry management and the coverage by planting trees is low, and there has never been any activity affecting the local ecosystem . By checking the afforestation plan with the forestry bureau of Qianxinan and Anshun, it was confirmed that, a small number of trees have been planted in some project area before the project started, but the coverage by planting trees is low. So considering the low forest coverage, the forestry bureau of Qianxinan and Anshun determined that the project area is suitable for afforestation after investigation, then the local forestry bureau approved the supplementary planting without disturbing the existing trees in January 2019 to increase the vegetative cover.","location":{"latitude":25.350000,"longitude":105.150000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-10","endExclusive":"2022-12-11","endInclusive":"2022-12-10"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3024"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou"}]}],"parti